{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"921a220806f68d66de57b27dd59223eb1b066e8d56be04c3105a8636a6e23e70","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":54,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶和華對以色列的愛"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"你這不懷孕、不生養的要歌唱；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你這未曾經過產難的要發聲歌唱，揚聲歡呼；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為沒有丈夫的比有丈夫的兒女更多。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要擴張你帳幕之地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"張大你居所的幔子，不要限止；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要放長你的繩子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"堅固你的橛子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你要向左向右開展；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的後裔必得多國為業，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又使荒涼的城邑有人居住。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"不要懼怕，因你必不致蒙羞；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不要抱愧，因你必不致受辱。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必忘記幼年的羞愧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不再記念你寡居的羞辱。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為造你的是你的丈夫；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬軍之耶和華是他的名。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"救贖你的是以色列的聖者；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他必稱為全地之上帝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華召你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如召被離棄心中憂傷的妻，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是幼年所娶被棄的妻。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是你上帝所說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我離棄你不過片時，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卻要施大恩將你收回。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的怒氣漲溢，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"頃刻之間向你掩面，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卻要以永遠的慈愛憐恤你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華－你的救贖主說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"這事在我好像挪亞的洪水。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我怎樣起誓不再使挪亞的洪水漫過遍地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也照樣起誓不再向你發怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不斥責你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大山可以挪開，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"小山可以遷移；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我的慈愛必不離開你；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我平安的約也不遷移。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是憐恤你的耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶路撒冷的將來"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"你這受困苦、被風飄蕩不得安慰的人哪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必以彩色安置你的石頭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以藍寶石立定你的根基；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又以紅寶石造你的女牆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以紅玉造你的城門，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以寶石造你四圍的邊界","poem":1},{"noteId":61},{"text":"。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的兒女都要受耶和華的教訓；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的兒女必大享平安。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必因公義得堅立，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必遠離欺壓，不致害怕；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必遠離驚嚇，驚嚇必不臨近你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即或有人聚集，卻不由於我；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凡聚集攻擊你的，必因你仆倒","poem":1},{"noteId":62},{"text":"。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吹噓炭火、打造合用器械的鐵匠是我所造；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"殘害人、行毀滅的也是我所造。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凡為攻擊你造成的器械必不利用；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凡在審判時興起用舌攻擊你的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必定他為有罪。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華僕人的產業，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是他們從我所得的義。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":61,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：外郭","reference":{"chapter":54,"verse":12}},{"noteId":62,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：投降你","reference":{"chapter":54,"verse":15}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/54.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/55.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/53.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}